cal research knowledge, EDC systems, data cleaning, query management, clinical data standards, SQL, statistics, and emerging AI-enabled data-quality technologies.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest entry-level combination is clinical research + clinical data management + EDC + Excel + SQL + GCP + CDISC awareness. This positions the graduate not only for Clinical Data Associate roles but also for progression into Clinical Data Management, Clinical Data Standards, Clinical Analytics, EDC Technology, Real-World Evidence, and AI-enabled clinical research."}]}]}